      "description": "The percentage you actually see in /usage, over time, per limit window. Gaps = Claude Code was not running (collection is statusline-driven; otel prometheus exporter metric_expiration ~5m). Account-wide: $service/$model filters intentionally not applied. Orange/red lines = 75%/90% caution thresholds."
